    "text": "WEAU-TV 13\nwebsite\nEau Claire\nArraignment for Shane Helmbrecht rescheduled\nBy WEAU Staff,\n12 hours agoEAU CLAIRE COUNTY, Wis. (WEAU) - An arraignment date is rescheduled for an Eau Claire man charged with killing his neighbor in 2016. An arraignment for 53-year-old Shane Helmbrecht was previously scheduled to take place Wednesday, Oct. 15, 2025. Court records show Wednesday, the state requested to adjourn the arraignment...\n2",
